OL,3,GNEWSATown should show uniqueness in
OL,4,Aculture bid - head judge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn island town should show what makes
OL,7,Fit unique in a bid to be crowned Town
OL,8,Fof Culture 2028, the competition's head
OL,9,Fjudge has said.
OL,11,FSir Phil Redmond visited Sandown on the
OL,12,FIsle of Wight on Wednesday as part of a
OL,13,Fa whirlwind tour of the British towns
OL,14,Fall bidding for the inaugural title.
OL,16,FIt is one of 15 to have made the
OL,17,Fshortlist in the Small Towns category.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
