OL,3,GNEWSATown should show uniqueness in
OL,4,Aculture bid - head judge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC during the informal
OL,7,Fvisit the Grange Hill and Brookside
OL,8,Fcreator said: "We want people to take a
OL,9,Fbreath really and look at their
OL,10,Fparticular place and say 'what is
OL,11,Funique about this particular place, why
OL,12,Fdo we like this place, why do we want
OL,13,Fto celebrate this place?'."
